# Google Drive OAuth Configuration
# Register an OAuth 2.0 Web Client in Google Cloud Console (public client, no secret):
# 1. Add Authorized JavaScript origins: https://valpr.github.io, http://localhost:5173, http://localhost:5174
# 2. Add Authorized Redirect URIs: https://valpr.github.io/reader/auth, http://localhost:5173/auth, http://localhost:5174/auth
# Flow is Authorization Code + PKCE (no implicit response_type=token).
VITE_GDRIVE_CLIENT_ID=

# Microsoft OneDrive OAuth Configuration
# Register an app in Azure Portal (App Registrations):
# 1. Supported account types: Personal Microsoft accounts only (or Accounts in any organizational directory and personal Microsoft accounts)
# 2. Add Single-Page Application (SPA) redirect URIs (NOT Web): https://valpr.github.io/reader/auth, http://localhost:5173/auth, http://localhost:5174/auth
# 3. Microsoft Graph API Permissions (Delegated): Files.ReadWrite.AppFolder, User.Read, offline_access (offline_access is required for refresh tokens)
VITE_ONEDRIVE_CLIENT_ID=
# Optional scope override (defaults to 'Files.ReadWrite.AppFolder User.Read offline_access')
# VITE_ONEDRIVE_SCOPE=Files.ReadWrite.AppFolder User.Read offline_access

# Deployment & Routing (Optional)
# VITE_PAGE_PATH=/reader
# BASE_PATH=/reader
